  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN279.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">poruḷvayiṟ pōkāniṉṟa talaimakaṉ ṟaṉṉeñciṟkuc colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What HE who was going for the sake of wealth said to his heart.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN279.1">
        <l>naṭṭō riṉmaiyuṅ kēḷir tuṉpamu</l>
        <l>moṭṭā tuṟaiyu<supplied>na</supplied>r perukkamuṅ kāṇūu</l>
        <l>morupati vāḻta lāṟṟu matalai</l>
        <l>poṉṉavir cuṇaṅkoṭu ceṟiya vīṅkiya</l>
        <l>meṉmulai muttaṅ kaṭavā tōreṉa</l>
        <l>naḷḷeṉ kaṅkulum pakalu miyaintiyain</l>
        <l>tuḷḷam pottiya vurañcuṭu kūreri</l>
        <l>yāḷviṉai māriyi ṉaviyā <supplied>nā</supplied>ḷu</l>
        <l>kaṭaṟuḻan tivaṇa mākap paṭaruḻan</l>
        <l>tiyāṅkā kuvaḷko ṟāṉē tīntoṭai</l>
        <l>viḷari narampi ṉayavaru cīṟiyā<supplied>ḻ</supplied></l>
        <l>malipūm poṅkar makiḻkura<supplied>ṟ</supplied> kuyiloṭu</l>
        <l>puṇartuyi leṭuppum puṉaṟeḷi kālaiyu</l>
        <l>nammuṭai matukaiya ḷāki yaṇinaṭai </l>
        <l>yaṉṉamāṇ peṭaiyiṉ me<supplied>ṉ</supplied>mela viyalik</l>
        <l>kaiyaṟu neñciṉa ḷaṭaitaru</l>
        <l>maiyī rōti māa yōḷē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="9c">While,</l>
        <l corresp="3">thinking it is possible to live with one abode as a support,</l>
        <l>where one sees the destitution of friends, the distress of relatives</l>
        <l corresp="1f">and the increase of those who remain unattached [to oneself],</l>
        <l corresp="5">[only] for those who do not go beyond the pearls on [her] soft breasts</l>
        <l corresp="4">that bulge tightly, with gold-shining beauty spots,</l>
        <l rend="indent2" corresp="9ab">we are here, enduring the wilderness,</l>
        <l corresp="6">deep night and day all alike(?),</l>
        <l corresp="8">daily, without man’s work ending, like the showers,</l>
        <l corresp="7">a strong burning sharp flame that smothers the mind,</l>
        <l corresp="9d-10c">what will become of her, suffering affliction?</l>
        <l corresp="13cd">all [this] time, when the flood is clear,</l>
        <l corresp="10d-11">when the languorous little lute with sweet string, strings [tuned to] Viḷari,</l>
        <l corresp="12">along with the delightful-voiced koel on the branches with ample flowers</l>
        <l rend="indent6" corresp="13ab">raise [people] from joint sleep,</l>
        <l>being one who has our strength, advancing very softly</l>
        <l corresp="14f">like the glorious female of the goose with ornate gait,</l>
        <l corresp="17">the dark woman with black moist hai</l>
        <l corresp="16">who comes close to being desolate at hear</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
